hadiths[22]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1962","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne beemaari naazil nahi ki magar uskey liye shifa naazil ki. (Bukhari: 5678)"
"1963","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Shifa teen mein hai: Seengi lagaaney waley key cheerey mein ya shehed key ghoont mein ya aag key daagh mein. Aur main apni ummat ko daagh se mana karta hun. (Bukhari: 5681)"
"1964","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Mera bhai pet ki shikaayat karta hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Use shehed pilaao! Phir doosri martaba aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Use shehed pilaao! Phir uskey paas teesri martaba aaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Use shehed pilaao! Phir uskey paas aaya. To us ne kaha: Main ne kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah ne sach kaha aur tumhaarey bhai key pet ne jhoot kaha. Use shehed pilaao! To us ne use pilaaya aur wo theek ho gaya. (Bukhari: 5684)"
"1965","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aap ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak ye kaala daana har beemaari mein shifa hai magar maut mein. Main ne kaha: Aur maut kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Maut. (Bukhari: 5687)"
"1966","[AI-translation] Mihsan ki beti Umm Qais (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Tum par ye Hindi lakdi laazim hai. Beshak us mein saat shifaen hain. Use naak mein daala jaata hai halaq ki sozish se aur pehlu mein daala jaata hai pehlu key dard se. Aur baaqi hadees guzar chuki hai. (Bukhari: 5693)"
"1967","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne seengi lagwai. Aap ko Abu Taiba ne seengi lagai. Wo guzar chuki hai. Unhon-ne kaha yahaan uskey aakhir mein: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak tum jiskay sath ilaaj kartey ho sab se umda seengi aur samandari qist hai. Aur farmaya: Apne bachchon ko halaq ki sozish se dabaaney se takleef na do! Aur tum par qist laazim hai. (Bukhari: 5696)"
"1968","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujh par ummatein pesh ki gaein. To Nabi aur do Nabi guzartey unkey sath giroh hota. Aur Nabi jiskay sath koi na hota. Yahan tak ke merey liye badi siyaahi uthai gai. Main ne kaha: Ye kya hai? Kya ye meri ummat hai? Kaha gaya: Balke ye Musa aur uski qaum hain. Kaha gaya: Ufaq ki taraf dekho! Phir siyaahi thi jo ufaq ko bharti thi. Phir mujh se kaha gaya: Yahaan aur yahaan aasmaan key kinaaron mein dekho! Phir siyaahi thi jo ufaq ko bhar chuki thi. Kaha gaya: Ye tumhaari ummat hai. Aur in mein se sattar hazaar Jannat mein baghair hisaab daakhil hongey. Phir Aap daakhil huey aur unhey wazeh nahi bataya. To qaum baat karney lagi aur unhon-ne kaha: Ham hain jo Allah par imaan laaey aur uskey Rasool ki pairwi ki, to ham wahi hain. Ya hamaari aulaad jo Islam mein paida hui. Beshak ham jaahiliyat mein paida huey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko pahunchi aur Aap nikley aur farmaya: Wo hain jo dam nahi karwaatey aur na shagun letey hain aur na daagh lagwaatey hain aur apne Rab par bharosa kartey hain. To Ukaasha bin Mihsan ne kaha: Kya main un mein hun Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. To doosra khada hua aur us ne kaha: Kya main un mein hun? Aap ne farmaya: Tum se Ukaasha sabqat ley gaya. (Bukhari: 5705)"
"1969","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chuhoot nahi hai aur na shagun aur na ullu aur na Safar. Aur kodhi se bhaago jaisa sher se bhaagtey ho. (Bukhari: 5707)"
"1970","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Dehaati ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! To meri oontniyon ka kya haal hai jo ret mein hiranon jaisi hoti hain aur khaarish wala oont aata hai aur unkey darmiyaan daakhil hota hai aur unhey khaarish wala kar deta hai. To Aap ne farmaya: To pehlon ko kis ne chuhoot lagaai. (Bukhari: 5717)"
"1971","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansaar key ghar walon ko ijazat di ke wo zeher aur kaan se dam karein. Anas ne kaha: Mujhey pehlu key dard se daagha gaya jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) zinda they. Aur merey paas Abu Talha aur Anas bin Nazr aur Zaid bin Saabit haazir they. Aur Abu Talha ne mujhey daagha. (Bukhari: 5721)"
"1972","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr ki beti Asma (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo jab aurat key paas laai jaati jo bukhaar mein hoti aur uskey liye dua karti. Paani leti aur use uskey aur uskey garebaan key darmiyaan daalti. Unhon-ne kaha: Jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein hukm detey they ke ham use paani se thanda karein. (Bukhari: 5724)"
"1973","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Taoon har Musalman key liye shahaadat hai. (Bukhari: 5732)"
"1974","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey hukm diya. Ya hukm diya ke nazar se dam kya jaey. (Bukhari: 5738)"
"1975","[AI-translation] Umm Salma (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uskey ghar mein londi dekhi jiskay chehrey mein nishaan tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Uskey liye dam karo, beshak usey nazar hai. (Bukhari: 5739)"
"1976","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne har zeher waley se dam ki rukhsat di. (Bukhari: 5741)"
"1977","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dam mein farmaatey they: Hamaari zameen ki mitti aur ham mein se baaz ka luaab, hamaara beemaar shifa paata hai hamaarey Rab key izn se. (Bukhari: 5746)"
"1978","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shagun nahi hai. Aur uska behtareen faal hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur faal kya hai Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Achhi baat jo tum mein se koi sunta hai. (Bukhari: 5755)"
"1979","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Huzail mein se do auraton mein faisla kya jo ladein. To un mein se aik ne doosri ko patthar maara aur uskey pet par laga jabke wo haamla thi aur uskey pet key bachchey ko qatl kar diya. To unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se muqadma kya. To Aap ne faisla kya ke uskey pet mein jo hai uski diyat ghulaam ya londi hai. To us aurat ka wali jis par jurmaana aaya tha kehta: Main kaisey jurmaana dun Ya Rasulullah uska jo na piya aur na khaaya aur na bola aur na cheekha. To us jaisa zaaya hai? To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ye kaahinon key bhaiyon mein se hai. (Bukhari: 5758)"
"1980","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke mashriq se do aadmi tashreef laaey aur unhon-ne khutba diya. To log unki bayaan se taajjub mein paday. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak bayaan mein jaadu hai. Ya beshak baaz bayaan jaadu hai. (Bukhari: 5767)"
"1981","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beemaar (oont) sehatmand par na laaey jaaein. (Bukhari: 5771)"
"1982","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo pahaad se giray aur apne aap ko qatl karey to wo Jahannum ki aag mein girayga. Us mein hamesha hamesha rahega. Aur jo zeher peey aur apne aap ko qatl karey to uska zeher uskey haath mein hoga jise wo Jahannum ki aag mein peeyega. Us mein hamesha hamesha rahega. Aur jo apne aap ko lohay se qatl karey to uska loha uskey haath mein hoga jise wo Jahannum ki aag mein apne pet mein ghonpayga. Us mein hamesha hamesha rahega. (Bukhari: 5778)"
"1983","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Abu Hurairah Raziallahu anhu se) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab makkhi tum mein se kisi key bartan mein giray to use poora dubo dey, phir use phenk dey. Beshak uskey aik par mein shifa hai aur doosrey mein beemaari hai. (Bukhari: 5782). Libaas ki kitaab."
